// SR 641.71 — Chapter 4 Emissions Trading System and Emissions Trading Registry
// generated by src/parse.py. Do not edit by hand.

:NOTE
Amended by No I of the FA of 15 March 2024, in force since 1 Jan. 2025 (AS 2024 376; BBl 2022 2651).
